 {:pattern "forward-model/the-forward-model-is-a-pattern-cascade" :turn "session ed69fb38, 2026-11-11T16:15:24.046120661Z, evidence emacs-d1ceee43f003a912322bce0c0f951169" :cited-by "kimi-2 mapping" :assignment {:IF "I1" :HOWEVER "I2" :BECAUSE "G" :THEN "B"} :status "occurrence" :schema :wm/three-halves-square-v1 :objects {:I1 {:text "The stack has both a retrospective strategy layer, attested rulings composed into a semilattice, and mission-level forward models such as the backlog cascade, and the design patterns are indexed and slot-queryable." :source {:path "futon3/library/forward-model/the-forward-model-is-a-pattern-cascade.flexiarg" :sha256 "d01455d258ce7d703b3336ce2c64617c1b8beeed56977abbdc4e72f8caf622b9"} :theory {:elems #{:local-cascades-local-regions-inside-gcc} :names {:local-cascades-local-regions-inside-gcc "local-cascades-local-regions-inside-gcc"} :axioms #{}} :situation-source "The relevance to the GCC is is that the local cascades would all be local regions inside the GCC."} :I2 {:text "Every existing forward model boxes the future as missions; none characterizes the future build through patterns, so the reusable form of how we build stays implicit in prose." :source {:path "futon3/library/forward-model/the-forward-model-is-a-pattern-cascade.flexiarg" :sha256 "d01455d258ce7d703b3336ce2c64617c1b8beeed56977abbdc4e72f8caf622b9"} :theory {:elems #{:voxterm-diagram-tab-start-incomplete} :names {:voxterm-diagram-tab-start-incomplete "voxterm-diagram-tab-start-incomplete"} :axioms #{}} :situation-source "We had some start on something like this in the Voxterm \"Diagram\" tab but it wasn't complete yet."} :B {:text "Model the next half-million lines as a cascade whose boxes are patterns and whose holes are the patterns that would have to be authored to reach the terminals, composed live from the indexed corpus rather than hand-drawn. The attested war-room patterns are the bottom; the forward-model hypotheticals are the frontier." :source {:path "futon3/library/forward-model/the-forward-model-is-a-pattern-cascade.flexiarg" :sha256 "d01455d258ce7d703b3336ce2c64617c1b8beeed56977abbdc4e72f8caf622b9"} :theory {:elems #{:wiring-diagram-session-cascades-hook-up} :names {:wiring-diagram-session-cascades-hook-up "wiring-diagram-session-cascades-hook-up"} :axioms #{}} :situation-source "some kind of wiring diagram that would run through a session, probably showing how the individual turn cascades hook up into a bigger diagram"} :G {:text "Patterns are reusable where missions are one-off. A future modeled as patterns tells you not just what to build but the shape of building it, and it composes with the retrospective semilattice into one continuous actual-to-projected object, the thing no current artifact provides. + evidence: Bridge target, not yet attested. Would fuse the backlog-cascade merged forward model, mission-level, and the pipeline-pattern-cascade, hand-drawn, into a pattern-level forward model, realized by this forward-model namespace itself." :source {:path "futon3/library/forward-model/the-forward-model-is-a-pattern-cascade.flexiarg" :sha256 "d01455d258ce7d703b3336ce2c64617c1b8beeed56977abbdc4e72f8caf622b9"} :theory {:elems #{:turn-potentially-cascade-null-if-none} :names {:turn-potentially-cascade-null-if-none "turn-potentially-cascade-null-if-none"} :axioms #{}} :situation-source "each turn can be thought of as \"potentially\" a cascade (a null cascade if no patterns are found)"}} :maps {:a1 #{[:turn-potentially-cascade-null-if-none :local-cascades-local-regions-inside-gcc]} :a2 #{[:turn-potentially-cascade-null-if-none :voxterm-diagram-tab-start-incomplete]} :b1 #{[:local-cascades-local-regions-inside-gcc :wiring-diagram-session-cascades-hook-up]} :b2 #{[:voxterm-diagram-tab-start-incomplete :wiring-diagram-session-cascades-hook-up]}} :auxiliary {:b1 false :b2 false} :check "Characterize the future build as a typed cascade of design patterns, boxes are patterns, wires are slot-adjacency, holes are patterns that should exist and do not, rather than as a list of missions."}]
